<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney ups aluminum makers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney ups aluminum makers.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised metals companies, moving Aluminum Co of America to a buy rating from outperform and Reynolds Metals Co to a buy from a neutral position previously, a source at the brokerage said.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Victor Lazarovici confirmed the move but declined to comment immediately on the uprades.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
